{
 "kind": "change_set",
 "rationale": "Adopt the security kit's dependency loop: the SBOM import, OSV, KEV and EPSS Lines and their Mandates; the security.start Runbook that seeds a fresh instance; and the security.maintain Runbook that the one daily Trigger security.maintain-daily runs (OSV, KEV, EPSS; the SBOM import runs when the SBOM changes). Tailor the Line names, the SBOM path, the cron time and the Mandate dates before submitting.",
